			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.293
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διχομήνη, ἡ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.14.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.173
			</span></i>.</div>
